model m1_inputs_of_balance
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.6 (#36, P1), for M1: E §3.2, §10, L §5.18: a cell's read set holds its walk reads, and inputs-of reports the rows behind them: b reads bal(konto, d + 1 day), so inputs-of b lists the opening, the rows of fee's day and amount the walk books (rate[q1]), and d, not rate[q2], which no movement on or before that day reads; total, a plain def, lists what it reads. M1 builds the memo's read sets and inputs-of (BUILD-ORDER M1)."

source card "T's invented card"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index qs = [q1, q2]

input amt: money PLN

input d: date

input late: date

input rate[k in qs]: num

def fee[k in qs]: money PLN = round(amt * rate[k], minor(PLN), half-up)

def total: money PLN = fee[q1] + fee[q2]

def b: money PLN = bal(konto, d + 1 day)

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay: transfers
  on d
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee[q1]

move later_pay: transfers
  on late
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee[q2]

ask ib: inputs-of b

ask it: inputs-of total

ask v: b, total

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN
  d = 2026-02-10
  late = 2026-09-01
  rate[q1] = 0.1
  rate[q2] = 0.2
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
